{
 "about": "Editable source of the ambience beds (#244). tools/audio_beds.py build renders every bed from these layers (times in seconds; start/dur cut the source, at places it in the bed (one time or a list), gain in dB, rate scales pitch and speed together, pan places a mono layer or balances a stereo one, mono folds a stereo source to the centre), folds the crossfade tail over the head so the loop is seamless, and normalises it to its category's integrated loudness (LUFS), capped at the true-peak ceiling (dBTP).",
 "output": "beds",
 "sample_rate": 48000,
 "channels": 2,
